    "description": "Functional and negative tests of the Offers REST API (bachelor thesis demo application). Requests authenticate with HTTP Basic using the username/password environment variables (role MANAGER). Run: newman run postman/offers-api.postman_collection.json -e postman/local.postman_environment.json",
